+# Icelandic characters, in Icelandic alphabetical order
+uplow \x00C1\x00E1 16 # Áá, a acute
+uplow \x00D0\x00F0 156 # Ðð, eth
+uplow \x00C9\x00E9 2346 # Éé, e acute
+uplow \x00CD\x00ED 126 # Íí, i acute 
