+sign          \x2032 4-35            #8242          PRIME
+sign          \x2033 4-35-35         #8243          DOUBLE PRIME
+
+# ===== CURRENCY SYMBOLS: 20A0-20CF ============================================
+
+sign          \x20A0 45-15                           EURO-CURRENCY SIGN
