+# liblouis: Korean (Base table and chars)
+#
+# Based on the braille contraction table in BRLTTY
+#
+# Copyright (C) 1995-2012 by The BRLTTY Team. 
+# Copyright (C) 2012 by Samuel Thibault <samuel.thibault@ens-lyon.org>
